    "167_2019_L": "Bill No. 167-F of  2019\nTHE APPROPRIATION (No. 2)  BILL, 2019\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT—\nLOK SABHA ON 17 JULY, 2019\nRAJYA SABHA ON 23 JULY, 2019)\nASSENTED  TO\n ON 26 JULY, 2019\nACT NO. 18 OF 2019\n\n1\nTHE APPROPRIATION (No. 2) BILL, 2019\n(AS PASSED BY THE HOUSES OF PARLIAMENT)\nA\nBILL\nto authorise payment and appropriation of certain sums from and out of the Consolidated\nFund of India for the services of the financial year 2019-20.\nBE it enacted by Parliament in the SeventiethYear of the Republic of India as follows:—\n1. This Act may be called the Appropriation (No. 2) Act, 2019.\n2. From and out of the Consolidated Fund of India there may be paid and applied\nsums not exceeding those specified in column 3 of the Schedule amounting in the aggregate\nto the sum of ninety-eight lakh eighteen thousand nine hundred three crore and eighty-two\nlakh rupees towards defraying the several charges which will come in course of payment\nduring the financial year 2019-20 in respect of the services specified in column 2 of the\nSchedule.\n3. The sums authorised to be paid and applied from and out of the Consolidated Fund\nof India by this Act shall be appropriated for the services and purposes expressed in the\nSchedule in relation to the said year.\n4. References to Ministries or Departments in the Schedule are to such Ministries or\nDepartments as existing immediately before the 19th June, 2019 and shall, on or after that\ndate, be construed as references to the appropriate Ministries or Departments as reconstituted\nfrom time to time.\nIssue of\nRs. 9818903,82,00,000\nout of the\nConsolidated\nFund of India for\nthe financial\nyear 2019-20.\nShort title.\nAppropriation.\nConstruction\nof references\nto Ministries\nor\nDepartments\nin the\nSchedule.\nBill No. 167-F of  2019\n\n2\nTHE  SCHEDULE\n(See sections 2 and 3)\n12 3\nSums not exceeding\nServices and purposes V oted Charged\nby Parliament on the T otal\nConsolidated\nFund\n   